golangci-lint patch carried by Speakeasy until upstream ships an equivalent fix.

Upstream: https://github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/issues/6822
Applies to: golangci-lint v2.15.0 (server/gcl/version).

Guards the facts debug calls in pkg/goanalysis behind their debug tags. The
calls are no-ops unless GL_DEBUG names the tag, but their variadic arguments
were still boxed into a fresh slice on every call, and inheritFacts makes one
call per inherited fact.

Remove when: the golangci-lint version in server/gcl/version no longer makes
these unconditional calls, or this patch stops applying after an upgrade.
0003-shared-facts.patch is written against the tree with this patch applied,
so regenerate it if you remove this one while keeping it.

